@startuml
title Task 7 - Query Evaluation Sequence

actor Tester
participant "test_rag_bot.py" as Eval
database "FAISS Index\n(task 7/artifacts)" as Index
collections "Chunks\n(chunks.jsonl)" as Chunks
database "logs.jsonl" as Logs
file "evaluation_report.md" as Report

Tester -> Eval: run golden set
loop each question
  Eval -> Index: vector search(top-k)
  Index --> Eval: candidate ids + scores
  Eval -> Chunks: load sources/text
  Chunks --> Eval: matched chunks
  alt score < threshold OR no relevant chunk
    Eval -> Eval: answer = "Я не знаю"
  else relevant chunk exists
    Eval -> Eval: build grounded answer
  end
  Eval -> Eval: compute status (expected vs actual)
  Eval -> Logs: append query/result/sources/length/status
end
Eval -> Report: write aggregate metrics + gaps + recommendations

note right of Eval
Possible failures:
- empty/corrupted index
- invalid chunk metadata
- low relevance search
- false positive "successful_answer"
end note

@enduml
